flowchart TB
    accTitle: Join the lobby with a parked player
    accDescr: Ada plays on the page and opens a lobby on Autodarts at the board of the display. On that page, the tile of each parked player in the popup and in the switcher offers Join the lobby. A tap on Bob's, or later on Join again below his tile, renews his parked session and keeps the rotated token first. When his session is dead or Autodarts can't be reached, his tile says why and nothing else changes. Otherwise the extension reads the lobby with his own access token, which never reaches the page. When Bob sits there already, the popup says so and Autodarts gets no second seat. Otherwise the extension seats Bob at the board of the display. When Autodarts refuses the seat because the lobby is full, closed or started, the popup says so. Otherwise his tile says In the lobby, with Join again below it for when the host takes him out, the page stays with Ada without a switch or a reload, and the match counts for both accounts.

    lobby["Ada plays on the page<br>and opens a lobby at the board of the display"]
    tiles["The popup and the switcher:<br>Join the lobby on each parked player's tile"]
    tap["A tap on Join the lobby below Bob's tile,<br>or later on Join again"]
    renew{"Renew Bob's parked session<br>and keep the rotated token"}
    why["Bob's tile says why:<br>sign in again, or try again later"]
    read{"Read the lobby<br>with Bob's own access token"}
    kept["The popup says Bob is still in the lobby;<br>Autodarts gets no second seat"]
    seat{"Seat Bob at the board of the display"}
    refused["The popup says so:<br>the lobby is full, closed or started"]
    seated["Bob's tile says In the lobby<br>and offers Join again below it;<br>the page stays with Ada, no switch, no reload"]
    stats["The match counts for Ada and for Bob"]

    lobby --> tiles --> tap --> renew
    renew -- "dead or unreachable" --> why
    renew -- "fresh" --> read
    read -- "Bob sits there already" --> kept
    read -- "no seat yet" --> seat
    seat -- "refused" --> refused
    seat -- "seated" --> seated --> stats

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class tiles,renew,read,seat bot
    class lobby,tap person
    class kept,seated,stats done
